#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function B<fread>()  reads I<nmemb> items of data, each I<size> bytes "
"long, from the stream pointed to by I<stream>, storing them at the location "
"given by I<ptr>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<fread>() lee I<nmiemb> elementos de datos, cada uno de I<tam> "
"bytes de largo, del flujo de datos apuntado por I<flujo>, almacenándolos en "
"el sitio apuntado por I<ptr>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The function B<fwrite>()  writes I<nmemb> items of data, each I<size> bytes "
"long, to the stream pointed to by I<stream>, obtaining them from the "
"location given by I<ptr>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<fwrite>() escribe I<nmiemb> elementos de datos, cada uno de "
"I<tam> bytes de largo, al flujo de datos apuntado por I<flujo>, "
"obteniéndolos del sitio apuntado por I<ptr>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For nonlocking counterparts, see B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."
msgstr "Para las versiones no-bloqueantes, véase B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DEVUELTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "B<fread> and B<fwrite> return the number of items successfully read or "
#| "written (i.e., not the number of characters).  If an error occurs, or the "
#| "end-of-file is reached, the return value is a short item count (or zero)."
msgid ""
"On success, B<fread>()  and B<fwrite>()  return the number of items read or "
"written.  This number equals the number of bytes transferred only when "
"I<size> is 1.  If an error occurs, or the end of the file is reached, the "
"return value is a short item count (or zero)."
msgstr ""
"B<fread> y B<fwrite> devuelven el número de elementos (no de caracteres) "
"leídos o escritos correctamente. Si ocurre un error o se llega al fin-de-"
"fichero, el valor devuelto es un número menor del esperado (o cero)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The file position indicator for the stream is advanced by the number of "
"bytes successfully read or written."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<fread>()  does not distinguish between end-of-file and error, and callers "
"must use B<feof>(3)  and B<ferror>(3)  to determine which occurred."
msgstr ""
"B<fread>() no distingue entre fin-de-fichero y error, así que quien llame a "
"esta función debe emplear B<feof>(3) y B<ferror>(3) para determinar qué ha "
"ocurrido."

